     "title_2": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:title": "Memory Less Scaler LSI for 4K60Hz",
      "type": "h1",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
     },
     "textwithimage_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/i-chips/images/c241.jpg",
      "imageRatio": "15",
      "alt": "Memory Less Scaler LSI for 4K60Hz",
      "text": "<p>The i-Chips IP00C241 is a sophisticated 4K60Hz scaler LSI designed for efficient image processing. With frame-memory-less scaling up/down, it supports&nbsp;<a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/ip-software/v-by-oner-hs-ip.html\">V-by-One® HS/LVDS</a>&nbsp;interfaces, serial flash interfaces for OSD setup, and 333MHz processing. It adheres to PQ and HLG HDR standards and offers input/output versatility for various color formats. Notable features include genlock support, resolution conversion, image quality control with color management, 3DLUT, uniformity correction, and HDR compatibility. The device also supports bit map OSD, facilitating graphic display, and operates on 3.3V, 2.5V, and 1.1V power supply. Its compact 385-pin BGA package ensures seamless integration for applications like display systems and medical imaging,&nbsp;where efficient image processing is crucial.</p>",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false"
     }
    },
    "container_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "backgroundColor": "rgb(247,247,247)",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498056876"
     ],
     "container_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Input/Output (4K60Hz x3)",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>@V-by-One® HS 4Gbps, 8-lane 2-port</p>\n<p>@LVDS 160MHz x 4, FPD-Link, 1-port</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>30-bit RGB/YUV4:4:4/ YUV4:2:0, 20-bit YUV4:2:2</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Up to 4K60Hz input/output (Any path can be selected from 3-input/output)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_2": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "In/Output Image Size",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><p>Horizontal synchronization signal interval: 16,384 pixels</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Effective horizontal image area: 2,176 pixels</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_3": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Frame lock",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><p>Genlock supported</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_4": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Resolution Conversion",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p><ul>\n<li>Scaling up/down: 6-symbol LUT, Coefficient ROM (64-set)</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: adobe-clean, &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, sans-serif;\">333Mpix/sec 2ch, support 4K60Hz single image processing</span></li>\n</ul>\n</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_5": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Image Quality Control",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><p>Color management (Full Color Gamma)</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>3DLUT (17x17x17)</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Uniformity correction (Coordinates Specification mode or Dot by Dot mode)</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Bias/Gain/Gamma</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Edge enhancer (Spatial Filter)</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Dithering (12 → 10, 10 → 8)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_6": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Image Correction",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><p>Flip function</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_7": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
